cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the FlyWire data, please cite the sources listed in CITATION.md (and complete this file)."
title: "flyputer / numcog — connectome simulations on the FlyWire adult Drosophila brain"
abstract: >-
  Simulation study on the FlyWire (hemibrain 783) connectome: number/operator coding,
  a gated table-based calculator (the fly core computes n->n+-1; the controller carries the
  state), reservoir dynamics in a CX sub-network, and DAN-gated KC->MBON plasticity in the
  mushroom body. No connectome-specific task advantage was demonstrated in this data, in this
  model, on this grid. See numcog/RESULTS_SUMMARY.md and numcog/PROJE_KAPANIS.md.
version: "1.0.0-draft"
date-released: "TODO"
